  rdfs:comment "The CEDS ISO 639-2 Language Code option set comes from the <a href=\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/langhome.html\">ISO 639-2 standard</a>, the character encoding in ISO 8859-1 download.  Discontinued codes from the ISO standard are not included in the CEDS list." ;
  ceds:editHistory (
   _:genid1209
   _:genid1211
 ) .

