  rdfs:label "Has Assessment Form Section Reentry" ;
  schema:domainIncludes ceds:C200020 ;
  schema:rangeIncludes ceds:C001194 ;
  skos:notation "hasAssessmentFormSectionReentry" ;
  dc11:description "Indicates that this section can be re-entered, meaning the test taker can return to this section after they have left the section. A common example of this is a two section test where one section does not allow the use of a calculator and the other does. Typically the test taker cannot return to the non-calculator section after they have used a calculator." .

ceds:P001193
