  rdfs:comment "Based on codes specified in the NCES Handbook <a href=\"http://nces.ed.gov/pubs2015/fin_acct/chapter6_3.asp\">\"Financial Accounting for Local and State School Systems: 2014 Edition\"</a>." ;
