  schema:rangeIncludes ceds:C001393 ;
  skos:notation "hasLearningResourceAssistiveTechnologiesCompatibleIndicator" ;
  dc11:description "Indicates that the learning resource is compatible with assistive technologies." ;
  rdfs:comment "For example, that the resource complies to Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.0 checkpoints: 1.1.1, 1.3.1, 1.3.2, 2.4.4, 3.1.1, 3.1.2, 3.3.2, 4.1.1, 4.1.2." .

