  rdfs:comment "A community of SEAs have agreed to use a limited set of Learning Resource Competency Alignment Type options when tagging learning resources in shared resource repositories. Those options are assesses, teaches, and requires." ;
  ceds:editHistory (
   _:genid1929
   _:genid1931
   _:genid1933
 ) .

