  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Trigonometry/Algebra courses combine trigonometry and advanced algebra
			topics, and are usually intended for students who have attained Algebra I and Geometry
			objectives. Topics typically include trigonometric and circular functions, inverses, and
