			subject area. These courses focus on content that is grade-specific and cover various
			subjects throughout the day, rather than a single subject-specific content area.
			Specific course content depends upon state standards for pre-kindergarten.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
  skos:notation "23002" ;
  skos:prefLabel "Pre-kindergarten" .

