ceds:NI001517163316
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """General Applied Mathematics courses reinforce general mathematics skills;
			extend these skills to include some pre-algebra and algebra topics; and use these skills
			in a variety of practical, consumer, business, and occupational applications. While
			these courses prepare students for a variety of practical applications, they are not
			intended to serve as remedial mathematics courses. Course topics typically include
			rational numbers, measurement, basic statistics, ratio and proportion, basic geometry,
			formulas, and simple equations.""" ;
  dc11:identifier "NI001517163316"^^xsd:token ;
  rdfs:label "General Applied Mathematics" ;
  skos:definition """General Applied Mathematics courses reinforce general mathematics skills;
			extend these skills to include some pre-algebra and algebra topics; and use these skills
			in a variety of practical, consumer, business, and occupational applications. While
			these courses prepare students for a variety of practical applications, they are not
			intended to serve as remedial mathematics courses. Course topics typically include
			rational numbers, measurement, basic statistics, ratio and proportion, basic geometry,
			formulas, and simple equations.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
  skos:notation "02151" ;
  skos:prefLabel "General Applied Mathematics" .

ceds:NI001517163317
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Occupationally Applied Mathematics courses reinforce general mathematics
			skills, extend these skills to include some pre-algebra and algebra topics, and use
			these skills primarily in occupational applications. While these courses prepare
