			as mentors, enable students to explore scientific topics of interest, using advanced
			methods of scientific inquiry and experimentation. These courses may be offered in
			conjunction with other science courses or may serve as an opportunity to explore a topic
			of special interest.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
  skos:notation "03047" ;
  skos:prefLabel "Earth Science—Independent Study" .

