ceds:NI001517163998
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Marketing—Transportation courses focus on the wide range of factors that
			influence the flow of goods and services from the producer to the consumer in the
			transportation industry. Topics may include purchasing and distribution systems,
			advertising, display and sales, management, and entrepreneurship with particular
			attention to the transportation industry. Emphasis may be placed on the identification
