			agricultural goods in domestic and international markets. Topics typically include
			appropriate market research; benefit/cost analysis of marketing; and methods of targeted
			agricultural marketing in domestic and international markets.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
  skos:notation "12168" ;
  skos:prefLabel "Marketing —Commodities" .

ceds:NI001517164303
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Plant Processing courses impart the knowledge and skills needed to bring
			plant products to market. They may cover a wide variety of topics, including plant
			production, quality selection and preservation, equipment care and sanitation,
			government regulations, and marketing and consumer trends. Plant Processing courses may
			present an overview of product processing or may specialize in specific plant products.""" ;
  dc11:identifier "NI001517164303"^^xsd:token ;
  rdfs:label "Plant Processing" ;
  skos:definition """Plant Processing courses impart the knowledge and skills needed to bring
			plant products to market. They may cover a wide variety of topics, including plant
			production, quality selection and preservation, equipment care and sanitation,
			government regulations, and marketing and consumer trends. Plant Processing courses may
			present an overview of product processing or may specialize in specific plant products.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
  skos:notation "18303" ;
  skos:prefLabel "Plant Processing" .

ceds:NI001517164304
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Animal Processing courses impart the knowledge and skills needed to bring
			animal products to market. Although these courses may present an overview of animal care
			and maintenance, they typically emphasize quality selection, product preservation,
			equipment care and sanitation, government regulations, and marketing and consumer
			trends. Animal Processing courses may present an overview of several types of animal
			products or may specialize in particular products, such as meat, leather, wool, dairy
			products, and so on.""" ;
  dc11:identifier "NI001517164304"^^xsd:token ;
  rdfs:label "Animal Processing" ;
  skos:definition """Animal Processing courses impart the knowledge and skills needed to bring
			animal products to market. Although these courses may present an overview of animal care
			and maintenance, they typically emphasize quality selection, product preservation,
			equipment care and sanitation, government regulations, and marketing and consumer
			trends. Animal Processing courses may present an overview of several types of animal
			products or may specialize in particular products, such as meat, leather, wool, dairy
			products, and so on.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
  skos:notation "18304" ;
  skos:prefLabel "Animal Processing" .

