			oral and written assignments. The course is designed for students highly competent in
			using Russian in an academic context and is intended for students with native or
			near-native fluency in the language.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
  skos:notation "24662" ;
  skos:prefLabel "IB Language A: Literature—Russian" .

