ceds:NI001517163708
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Gymnastics courses are designed to help students develop knowledge and
			skills in gymnastics, stunts, and tumbling while emphasizing safety. Floor gymnastics
			may be supplemented by the use of gymnastic equipment such as balance beam, uneven bars,
			parallel bars, rings, and so on. Gymnastic courses may include other components such as
			the history of gymnastics and conditioning.""" ;
