ceds:NI001517163721
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Religious Figures courses offer students the opportunity to examine the
			lives and messages of one or several people who are central to a religious faith, such
			as a prophet, apostle, philosopher, or leader. In addition to a historical study of the
			person (or people), these courses typically emphasize how the teachings of these
			individuals influence the faith and culture of a religious group.""" ;
