			that provides confinement of its residents, for the care of children who have been
			adjudicated to be delinquent or in need of supervision. Similar to juvenile correctional
			facility.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C002085 ;
  skos:notation "JUVLNGTRMFAC" ;
  skos:prefLabel "Long-term secure juvenile facility" .

