ceds:NI001517163438
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """World Geography courses provide students with an overview of world
			geography, but may vary widely in the topics they cover. Topics typically include the
			physical environment; the political landscape; the relationship between people and the
			land; economic production and development; and the movement of people, goods, and ideas.""" ;
