			such as freestyle, breaststroke, butterfly, and so on or may involve team-oriented water
			sports, such as water polo and relay swimming. These courses may also include (or
			concentrate exclusively on) diving and/or lifesaving skills.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
  skos:notation "08010" ;
  skos:prefLabel "Aquatics/Water Sports" .

