  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Self-defense courses help students develop knowledge, skills, and abilities
			to defend themselves against attack by others, usually incorporating traditional
			self-defense methods. Students may also be taught techniques from martial arts,
			addressing the differences among those arts and their contribution to defense and sport.""" ;
