  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Courses in Sports Physiology examine human anatomy and physiology as they
			pertain to human movement and physical performance in sports activities. These courses
			may also emphasize the prevention and treatment of athletic injuries.""" ;
