  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """State-Specific Studies courses examine the history, politics, economics,
			society, and/or cultures of one state in the United States. This course may focus
			primarily on the history of that state or may take an interdisciplinary approach to the
			contemporary issues affecting it.""" ;
