ceds:NI001517163772
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Safety and First Aid courses provide specialized instruction in first aid
			techniques, cardiopulmonary resuscitation (CPR), relief of obstructed airways, and
			general safety procedures and behaviors. These courses may include such topics as an
			overview of community agencies and hotlines providing emergency care and information and
			opportunities for first aid and CPR certification.""" ;
  dc11:identifier "NI001517163772"^^xsd:token ;
  rdfs:label "Safety and First Aid" ;
  skos:definition """Safety and First Aid courses provide specialized instruction in first aid
			techniques, cardiopulmonary resuscitation (CPR), relief of obstructed airways, and
			general safety procedures and behaviors. These courses may include such topics as an
			overview of community agencies and hotlines providing emergency care and information and
			opportunities for first aid and CPR certification.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
  skos:notation "08055" ;
  skos:prefLabel "Safety and First Aid" .

ceds:NI001517163773
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Designed for pregnant teens and/or parents, topics within Health for
			Parenting Teens courses cover a wide range of both health and parenting issues,
			typically including prenatal and postnatal care, health and well-being of young parents,
			child development, stress management, and parental/adult roles. The courses may also
			involve academic assistance, career exploration, financial management, and so on.""" ;
  dc11:identifier "NI001517163773"^^xsd:token ;
  rdfs:label "Health for Parenting Teens" ;
  skos:definition """Designed for pregnant teens and/or parents, topics within Health for
			Parenting Teens courses cover a wide range of both health and parenting issues,
			typically including prenatal and postnatal care, health and well-being of young parents,
			child development, stress management, and parental/adult roles. The courses may also
			involve academic assistance, career exploration, financial management, and so on.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
  skos:notation "08056" ;
  skos:prefLabel "Health for Parenting Teens" .

ceds:NI001517163774
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Health and Life Management courses focus as much on consumer education
			topics (such as money management and evaluation of consumer information and advertising)
			as on personal health topics (such as nutrition, stress management, drug/alcohol abuse
			prevention, disease prevention, and first aid). Course objectives include helping
			students develop decision-making, communication, interpersonal, and coping skills and
			strategies.""" ;
  dc11:identifier "NI001517163774"^^xsd:token ;
  rdfs:label "Health and Life Management" ;
  skos:definition """Health and Life Management courses focus as much on consumer education
			topics (such as money management and evaluation of consumer information and advertising)
			as on personal health topics (such as nutrition, stress management, drug/alcohol abuse
			prevention, disease prevention, and first aid). Course objectives include helping
			students develop decision-making, communication, interpersonal, and coping skills and
			strategies.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
  skos:notation "08057" ;
  skos:prefLabel "Health and Life Management" .

ceds:NI001517163775
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Substance Abuse Prevention courses focus specifically on the health risks of
			drugs, alcohol and tobacco. These courses provide information on the negative
			consequences of these products and teach students coping strategies to resist the
			influences (such as peers and media images) that may entice them to use these
			substances. Students may also explore the community resources available to them.""" ;
  dc11:identifier "NI001517163775"^^xsd:token ;
  rdfs:label "Substance Abuse Prevention" ;
  skos:definition """Substance Abuse Prevention courses focus specifically on the health risks
			of drugs, alcohol and tobacco. These courses provide information on the negative
			consequences of these products and teach students coping strategies to resist the
			influences (such as peers and media images) that may entice them to use these
			substances. Students may also explore the community resources available to them.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
  skos:notation "08058" ;
  skos:prefLabel "Substance Abuse Prevention" .

ceds:NI001517163776
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Health Education (early childhood education) courses emphasize the knowledge
			and skills that promote sound bodies and minds, prevent disease and dysfunction, and
			reduce risk. Topics typically involve nutrition and healthy eating habits; growth and
			development; injury prevention and safety; mental, emotional, and social health;
			alcohol, tobacco, and other drugs; physical activity; community health; and factors that
			influence health. Specific content depends upon state standards for early childhood
			education.""" ;
  dc11:identifier "NI001517163776"^^xsd:token ;
  rdfs:label "Health Education (early childhood education)" ;
  skos:definition """Health Education (early childhood education) courses emphasize the
			knowledge and skills that promote sound bodies and minds, prevent disease and
			dysfunction, and reduce risk. Topics typically involve nutrition and healthy eating
			habits; growth and development; injury prevention and safety; mental, emotional, and
			social health; alcohol, tobacco, and other drugs; physical activity; community health;
			and factors that influence health. Specific content depends upon state standards for
			early childhood education.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
  skos:notation "08068" ;
  skos:prefLabel "Health Education (early childhood education)" .

