  skos:prefLabel "Technological Literacy" .

ceds:NI001517164430
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Technological Processes courses provide students with the opportunity to
			focus on one or more areas of industrial technology, applying technological processes to
			solve real problems and developing the knowledge and skills to design, modify, use, and
			apply technology appropriately. Students may examine case studies, explore simulations,
			or design and build prototypes and working models.""" ;
