  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Drafting—Civil/Structural courses introduce students to and help them refine
			the technical craft of drawing illustrations to represent and/or analyze design
			specifications, using examples drawn from civil engineering and/or structural
			applications. These courses are intended to help students develop general drafting
			skills, but place a particular emphasis on skills needed for typography and survey work.""" ;
