  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """The standard high school diploma awarded to the preponderance of students in
			the state that is fully aligned with state standards, or a higher diploma, except that a
			regular high school diploma shall not be aligned to the alternate academic achievement
			standards described in section 1111(b)(1)(E) of the Every Student Succeeds Act; and does
			not include a recognized equivalent of a diploma, such as a general equivalency diploma,
			certificate of completion, certificate of attendance, or similar lesser credential.""" ;
