			the needs and concerns of teenage students who are pregnant or are concerned about
			becoming pregnant or impregnating.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C000273 ;
  skos:notation "00325" ;
  skos:prefLabel "Teen/adolescent family planning" .

