  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description "Language Arts (early childhood education) courses develop students' readiness for language arts learning in reading, writing, listening, and speaking. Courses may include activities related to phonics, phonemic awareness, and vocabulary. Content is age appropriate and conforms to any existing state standards for early childhood education." ;
