			change, and the relationships among individuals and groups in society.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
  skos:notation "04258" ;
  skos:prefLabel "Sociology" .

ceds:NI001517163498
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Government, Politics, and Law—Workplace Experience courses provide students
			with work experience in a field related government, politics, and/or law. Goals are
			typically set cooperatively by the student, teacher, and employer (although students are
			not necessarily paid). These courses may include classroom activities as well, involving
			further study of the field or discussion regarding experiences that students encounter
			in the workplace.""" ;
  dc11:identifier "NI001517163498"^^xsd:token ;
  rdfs:label "Government, Politics and Law—Workplace Experience" ;
