			typically set cooperatively by the student, teacher, and employer (although students are
			not necessarily paid). These courses may include classroom activities as well, involving
			further study of the field or discussion regarding experiences that students encounter
			in the workplace.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
  skos:notation "04198" ;
