			increasing technological world, these courses focus on mathematical concepts used as
			applications and in mathematical modeling. Course topics include numbers and algebra,
			functions, geometry and trigonometry, statistics and probability, and calculus.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
