ceds:NI000488172912
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C000488, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """School-related arrest, which is an arrest of a student for any activity
			conducted on school grounds, during off-campus school activities (including while taking
			school transportation), or due to a referral by any school official, is a consequence of
			an incident for the student(s) involved in an incident as perpetrator(s). All
			school-related arrests are also considered Law Enforcement Referrals, but not all Law
			Enforcement Referrals are School-Related arrests.""" ;
