ceds:NI001517162889
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description "German for Native Speakers courses prepare native and heritage speakers to communicate in German in all modes. These courses reinforce and expand students' skills to interpret (read, listen, view) and present (speak, write) information at the same level as they exchange (speak and listen; read and write) information, concepts, and ideas on a variety of topics. German for Native Speakers courses advance students' understanding of the relationships among the products, practices, and perspectives of the cultures included in the German-speaking world." ;
  dc11:identifier "NI001517162889"^^xsd:token ;
  rdfs:label "German for Native Speakers" ;
  skos:definition "German for Native Speakers courses prepare native and heritage speakers to communicate in German in all modes. These courses reinforce and expand students' skills to interpret (read, listen, view) and present (speak, write) information at the same level as they exchange (speak and listen; read and write) information, concepts, and ideas on a variety of topics. German for Native Speakers courses advance students' understanding of the relationships among the products, practices, and perspectives of the cultures included in the German-speaking world." ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
  skos:notation "24257" ;
  skos:prefLabel "German for Native Speakers" .

