  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description "Reading (grade 2) courses focus on reading skills and may build students' skills in independent reading by increasing reading fluency, vocabulary, and recognition of word and language patterns. Specific content depends upon state standards for grade 2." ;
