ceds:NI001517164514
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description "Following Project Lead the Way's suggested curriculum, PLTW Engineering Essentials courses focus on introducing students to engineering-related career opportunities. Students learn about engineers and how their work is used to solve real-world problems. Topics include the engineering design process, machines and mechanical systems, energy forms, and the application of geographic information systems and modeling software." ;
  dc11:identifier "NI001517164514"^^xsd:token ;
  rdfs:label "PLTW Engineering Essentials" ;
  skos:definition "Following Project Lead the Way's suggested curriculum, PLTW Engineering Essentials courses focus on introducing students to engineering-related career opportunities. Students learn about engineers and how their work is used to solve real-world problems. Topics include the engineering design process, machines and mechanical systems, energy forms, and the application of geographic information systems and modeling software." ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
  skos:notation "21026" ;
  skos:prefLabel "PLTW Engineering Essentials" .

ceds:NI001517164515
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description "Following Project Lead the Way's curriculum, the PLTW Engineering Design and Development course is a capstone course for the PLTW Engineering program. Students use knowledge obtained in previous courses to identify an issue and research and design a solution. Students may present the results of their solution to a panel of engineers." ;
  dc11:identifier "NI001517164515"^^xsd:token ;
  rdfs:label "PLTW Engineering Design and Development" ;
  skos:definition "Following Project Lead the Way's curriculum, the PLTW Engineering Design and Development course is a capstone course for the PLTW Engineering program. Students use knowledge obtained in previous courses to identify an issue and research and design a solution. Students may present the results of their solution to a panel of engineers." ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
  skos:notation "21025" ;
  skos:prefLabel "PLTW Engineering Design and Development" .

