ceds:NI001517164518
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """IB Language Ab Initio—English courses prepare students to take the
			International Baccalaureate exam. These courses focus on developing the linguistic
			abilities of students with little or no experience with the language of study. Course
			content includes the study of individuals and society, leisure and work, and urban and
			rural environments. These courses also provide students with the opportunity to practice
			and explore this language.""" ;
