  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Writing (grade 1) courses focus on writing skills and may emphasize
			recognition and creation of various types of text; extension of vocabulary and writing
			skills; and the connection of language to the expression of ideas. Specific content
			depends upon state standards for grade 1.""" ;
