ceds:NI001517163264
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Mathematics (grade 1) courses typically help build a conceptual foundation
			in number, operation, and quantitative reasoning; patterns, relationships, and algebraic
			thinking; geometry and spatial reasoning; time and non-standard length units. These
			courses often require students to develop their numerical fluency and to make
			calculation predictions. Specific content depends upon state standards for grade 1.""" ;
