			computers. Additional topics covered in the course include information storage and
			retrieval. Drafting equipment may be used to make scale drawings, including multi-view
			drawing, photographs, and poster mock-ups.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001517 ;
  skos:notation "11002" ;
  skos:prefLabel "Communication Technology" .

