  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001517, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """Agriculture—Comprehensive courses cover a wide range of agricultural topics,
			including plant and animal science, production, and processing; agricultural mechanics;
			food production for global populations; construction and repair of farm structures;
			business operations and management; and the careers available in the agricultural
			industry. These courses may also include topics such as chemical and soil science,
			ecology, agricultural marketing, and veterinary science.""" ;
