  dc11:description "Data Literacy courses focus on developing students' ability to read, interpret, and analyze data. These courses teach students how to assess the reliability and validity of data, as well as to understand data to draw conclusions and explain the results, such as through summary statistics or data visualization." ;
  dc11:identifier "NI001517164550"^^xsd:token ;
