			safety of students, staff, or visitors and/or for operation of the program or service to
			continue. Unexpected events beyond normal wear and tear may mandate overtime, as
			situations may have to be dealt with immediately.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001876 ;
  skos:notation "02989" ;
  skos:prefLabel "Emergency maintenance repair" .

ceds:NI001876129114
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001876, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """The process of monitoring selected performance data for a system, component,
			or equipment against a baseline reference to identify and predict impending failures for
			just-in-time maintenance attention. A system of maintenance in which computers and
			software are used to forecast the failure of a piece of equipment based on its age, user
			demand, and various performance measures.""" ;
  dc11:identifier "NI001876129114"^^xsd:token ;
  rdfs:label "Predictive" ;
  skos:definition """The process of monitoring selected performance data for a system,
			component, or equipment against a baseline reference to identify and predict impending
			failures for just-in-time maintenance attention. A system of maintenance in which
			computers and software are used to forecast the failure of a piece of equipment based on
			its age, user demand, and various performance measures.""" ;
  skos:inScheme ceds:C001876 ;
  skos:notation "02839" ;
  skos:prefLabel "Predictive" .

ceds:NI001876129115
  a owl:NamedIndividual, ceds:C001876, skos:Concept ;
  dc11:creator "Common Education Data Standards" ;
  dc11:description """The process of performing scheduled equipment inspection, testing, and
			repair services. Activities are performed on a scheduled basis annually, or more
			frequently, to identify additional maintenance or required systems testing.""" ;
  dc11:identifier "NI001876129115"^^xsd:token ;
  rdfs:label "Preventive" ;
  skos:definition """The process of performing scheduled equipment inspection, testing, and
			repair services. Activities are performed on a scheduled basis annually, or more
