_:genid183
  a ceds:editHistoryEntry ;
  ceds:changeNotes "Entity name changed from \"Competency Item\" to \"Competency Definition\" to support alignment across standards and reduce confusion by those who might think this is a \"competency assertion\" that is attributed to a person rather than what it is, a definition of a competency that could apply to any person." ;
  ceds:version "8" .

_:genid185
  a ceds:editHistoryEntry ;
  ceds:changeNotes "Entity name changed from \"Competency Item\" to \"Competency Definition\" to support alignment across standards and reduce confusion by those who might think this is a \"competency assertion\" that is attributed to a person rather than what it is, a definition of a competency that could apply to any person." ;
  ceds:version "8" .

_:genid187
  a ceds:editHistoryEntry ;
  ceds:changeNotes """This updated definition and usage note for this element aligns with concept in the CEASN vocabulary. It provides a URL as a universal identifier for the type or class of the Competency Item. CEDS previously had the Competency Item Type element but not an element for specifying the URL that points to a definition of that type. It is based on ceasn:competencyCategory.  

Entity name changed from "Competency Item" to "Competency Definition" to support alignment across standards and reduce confusion by those who might think this is a "competency assertion" that is attributed to a person rather than what it is, a definition of a competency that could apply to any person.""" ;
  ceds:version "8" .

