  ceds:version "10" .

_:genid317
  a ceds:editHistoryEntry ;
  ceds:changeNotes """Elements for Credential Award were incorrectly included in Credential (Definition). Proposed corrections:
1. Remove "Credential Start Date" and "Credential End Date" from DES under "Credential" ( keep under Credential Award) 
2. Rename "Credential Start Date" to "Credential Award Start Date"
3. Rename " Credential End Date" to "Credential Award End Date" 

Adding usage note to clarify that exit dates are inclusive, i.e. the dates represent the last day that the person was enrolled, participated, or received services, not the day after.""" ;
  ceds:version "8" .

