_:genid363
  a ceds:editHistoryEntry ;
  ceds:changeNotes "New element to reflect the date on which a Credential Definition became effective. Based on CE term ceterms:dateEffective. Note: This is the date the content/definition of the credential became effective, not necessarily the date that one or more credentialing organizations began offering the credential." ;
  ceds:version "8" .

_:genid365
  a ceds:editHistoryEntry ;
  ceds:changeNotes "Adjusted credential elements, definitions, and DES context to apply to an organization in addition to a person." ;
  ceds:version "10" .

_:genid367
  a ceds:editHistoryEntry ;
  ceds:changeNotes """Entity name changed from "Credential" to "Credential Definition" to support alignment across standards and reduce confusion by those who might think this is a "credential assertion" awarded to a person rather than what it is, i.e. a definition of a credential that could be awarded to any person.

The new wording of the element definition makes it clearer that this entity is a credential definition, not a credential assertion.""" ;
  ceds:version "8" .

